    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>No fever, night sweats, or weight loss</td></tr><tr><td>Eyes</td><td>Negative</td><td>No vision change</td></tr><tr><td>Ears, nose, mouth, and throat</td><td>Negative</td><td>No hoarseness or voice change; no dental pain</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Negative</td><td>No chest pain or palpitations</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Negative</td><td>No cough or breathlessness</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No abdominal pain, vomiting, black stools, or yellowing of the skin; constipation settled with fiber</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Negative</td><td>No abnormal bleeding or discharge</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No joint pain</td></tr><tr><td>Integumentary</td><td>Negative</td><td>No skin infections or abscesses</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Negative</td><td>No numbness, tremor, or unsteadiness</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Negative</td><td>Mood better; PHQ-9 score 6; no thoughts of suicide or self-harm; cravings occasional and manageable</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>11 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
