    <code code="42348-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Advance directives"/>
    <title>Advance Care Planning</title>
    <text><paragraph>Voluntary advance care planning discussion of about 16 minutes, with her consent. She named a health care agent, and a health care proxy form was completed; the agent is recorded in the confidential part of the chart and is not named here. She said that what matters most to her is her music, being treated with respect, and deciding for herself who learns about her health. She chose not to record specific treatment preferences today. The plan will be revisited yearly or after any serious illness. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
